Hi Dylan, and any future readers,

I am sheepishly realizing that we actually already provide this functionality in the version of NIMBLE on CRAN. To see the individual pWAIC values, take the compiled MCMC object (this won't work if using the nimbleMCMC function) and run:

mcmcObj$getWAICdetails(returnElements = TRUE)

and look at the pWAIC_elements item of the resulting list. There's some documentation in `?WAIC`.

-chris

